---
import BasePage from "../layouts/BasePage.astro";
---

<BasePage title="アスノヨゾラ哨戒班" description="Lyrics: Orangestar - Asu no Yozora Shoukaihan (Night Sky Patrol of Tomorrow)">
    <h1>アスノヨゾラ哨戒班</h1>
    <p>Orangestar feat. IA — Night Sky Patrol of Tomorrow</p>
    <iframe id="yt" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/XogSflwXgpw?enablejsapi=1" title="アスノヨゾラ哨戒班" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media" allowfullscreen></iframe>

    <section lang="ja">
        <p>
            <span class="l" data-t="1.1">気分次第です僕は　敵を選んで戦う少年</span><br />
            <span lang="en">It all depends on my mood, I'm a boy who chooses his enemies and fights</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="5.7">叶えたい未来も無くて　夢に描かれるのを待ってた</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Without a future I want to fulfill, waiting for it to be drawn in my dreams</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="10.9">そのくせ未来が怖くて　明日を嫌って過去に願って</span><br />
            <span lang="en">But I'm scared of the future, hating tomorrow and wishing for the past</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="15.9">もう如何(どう)しようも無くなって叫ぶんだ</span><br />
            <span lang="en">I'm at a loss and I scream</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="18.9">明日よ明日よもう来ないでよって</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Tomorrow! Tomorrow! Don't come anymore!</span><br />
            <br />
            <span class="l" data-t="21.7">そんな僕を置いて　月は沈み陽は昇る</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Leaving me like that, the moon sets and the sun rises</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="26.6">けどその夜(よ)は違ったんだ　君は僕の手を</span><br />
            <span lang="en">But that night was different, you took my hand</span><br />
            <br />
            <span class="l" data-t="34.4">空へ舞う　世界の彼方　闇を照らす魁星(かいせい)</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Beyond the world dancing in the sky, illuminating the darkness</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="37.3">「君と僕もさ、また明日へ向かっていこう」</span><br />
            <span lang="en">"You and I, let's head towards tomorrow again"</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="40.7">夢で終わってしまうのならば　昨日を変えさせて</span><br />
            <span lang="en">If it's going to end in a dream, "Let me change yesterday"</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="50.3">なんて言わないから　また明日も君とこうやって　笑わせて</span><br />
            <span lang="en">I won't say that, so let's laugh together like this tomorrow too</span>
        </p>
        <p>
            <span class="l" data-t="86.6">あれから世界は変わったって　本気で思ったって</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Since then, even if I seriously thought the world had changed</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="91.4">期待したって変えようとしたって　未来は残酷で</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Even if I hoped and tried to change it, the future is cruel</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="96.7">それでもいつだって君と見ていた　世界は本当に綺麗だった</span><br />
            <span lang="en">But the world we always watched together was truly beautiful</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="102.9">忘れてないさ　思い出せるように仕舞ってるの</span><br />
            <span lang="en">I haven't forgotten, I keep it so I can remember</span><br />
            <br />
            <span class="l" data-t="107.1">君がいてもいなくても翔べるなんて妄想</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Whether you're here or not, the delusion that I can fly</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="110">独りじゃ歩くことさえ僕はしないまま藍色の風に吐いた幻想</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Without walking alone, I entered a fantasy of indigo wind</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="115.3">壊してくれって願って踠(もが)いたって</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Even if I wish for it to be destroyed and struggle</span><br />
            <br />
            <span class="l" data-t="120.4">願ったんなら叶えてしまえやって</span><br />
            <span lang="en">If I wished for it, you said to make it come true</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="124.2">Eh…　君は言って</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Eh… you said</span>
        </p>
        <p>
            <span class="l" data-t="130.7">また明日の夜に　逢いに行こうと思うが</span><br />
            <span lang="en">I think I'll go see you again tomorrow night</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="136">どうかな君はいないかな</span><br />
            <span lang="en">I wonder, are you not there?</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="137.9">それでもいつまでも僕ら一つだから</span><br />
            <span lang="en">But we'll always be together</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="141">またね　Sky Arrow　笑ってよう</span><br />
            <span lang="en">See you later, Sky Arrow, let's smile</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="145.4">未来を少しでも君といたいから叫ぼう</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Let's shout because I want to be with you a little in the future</span><br />
            <span class="l" data-t="148.4">今日の日をいつか思い出せ　未来の僕ら</span><br />
            <span lang="en">Remember this day someday, the future us</span>
        </p>
    </section>
</BasePage>

<script>
    const tag = document.createElement('script');
    tag.src = 'https://www.youtube.com/iframe_api';
    document.head.append(tag);
    let player: any;
    (window as any).onYouTubeIframeAPIReady = () => {
        player = new YT.Player('yt');
        setInterval(() => {
            if (!player.getCurrentTime) return;
            const t = player.getCurrentTime();
            let active: Element | undefined;
            for (const el of document.querySelectorAll('.l')) {
                if (Number((el as HTMLElement).dataset.t) <= t) active = el;
                else break;
            }
            document.querySelectorAll('.l.on').forEach((e) => e.classList.remove('on'));
            active?.classList.add('on');
        }, 250);
    };
</script>

<style>
    iframe {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
        border: 0;
    }
    section { margin-block: 1.5rem; }
    span { color: #888; }
    .l { color: #ccc; transition: color 0.3s; }
    .l.on { color: var(--color); }
</style>
